(1145282, 141603, 31597, '<td valign="top">i love the light "stars" coming from the street lamps, not to metion your subjuct street sign is hiarious.  Everything thing else looks crisp and clean. yay! :)</td>', 'i love the light "stars" coming from the street lamps, not to metion your subjuct street sign is hiarious.  Everything thing else looks crisp and clean. yay! :)', '2005-02-02 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145284, 142417, 10943, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  It made me laugh.  I only wish it was bigger -- it would have scored better at the allowed 640.  8</td>', 'This is a great idea.  It made me laugh.  I only wish it was bigger -- it would have scored better at the allowed 640.  8', '2005-02-02 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145285, 142123, 25232, '<td valign="top">I helped work on a highrise there years ago. We had to weld a 24" steam stack up the side of one of the buildings on the east side of the square. Hope it hasn''t fallen yet.<br/> <br/>By the way, are you allowed to walk in the park now or is that prohibited too.</td>', 'I helped work on a highrise there years ago. We had to weld a 24" steam stack up the side of one of the buildings on the east side of the square. Hope it hasn''t fallen yet. By the way, are you allowed to walk in the park now or is that prohibited too.', '2005-02-02 00:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145287, 141291, 31597, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you had to desaturate the colors of the trees or was it already like that?  Anyway, cute sign makes for a good subject.  The depth of the trees is nice as well.</td>', 'I wonder if you had to desaturate the colors of the trees or was it already like that?  Anyway, cute sign makes for a good subject.  The depth of the trees is nice as well.', '2005-02-02 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145289, 141570, 31597, '<td valign="top">somehow i think this photo would look better in color rather than the ''old-timey'' look.  I think it takes the personality out of it.  Nice pick of your subject though.</td>', 'somehow i think this photo would look better in color rather than the ''old-timey'' look.  I think it takes the personality out of it.  Nice pick of your subject though.', '2005-02-02 00:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145290, 141603, 25232, '<td valign="top">What the f...!</td>', 'What the f...!', '2005-02-02 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145291, 142538, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky.  I''m not a huge fan of the actual sign.  Doesnt command attention.  Very nice though.  Solid 7, with a possible bump later :)</td>', 'Very nice sky.  I''m not a huge fan of the actual sign.  Doesnt command attention.  Very nice though.  Solid 7, with a possible bump later :)', '2005-02-02 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
