(1145295, 142466, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea.  I would ahve liked to see the blurred vehical on the other side of the sign (so the sign was composed in a more interesting place within the photo.)  I think the sign gets a little los in the middle.  Great idea though.</td>', 'Very interesting idea.  I would ahve liked to see the blurred vehical on the other side of the sign (so the sign was composed in a more interesting place within the photo.)  I think the sign gets a little los in the middle.  Great idea though.', '2005-02-02 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
