(1145301, 141962, 31213, '<td valign="top">I really dont like all of the "photo debri" beyond the van.  Perhaps a different crop would''ve please me more.  Hold your hand above the top part of the picture (a quick crop) and notice how muc more powerful the image is.  The sign almost points to the van if you crop the top off.  Nice effort.</td>', 'I really dont like all of the "photo debri" beyond the van.  Perhaps a different crop would''ve please me more.  Hold your hand above the top part of the picture (a quick crop) and notice how muc more powerful the image is.  The sign almost points to the van if you crop the top off.  Nice effort.', '2005-02-02 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
