(1145393, 142717, 25355, '<td valign="top">What? What? What? What country has roadsigns like this? What does it mean? What were you thinking? What? What? What?<br/>   Okay, in Japan there are road construction signs with photos of flowers and animals, and cartoon drawings of animals (I almost took a shot of an elephant yesterday), but always accompanied by text.<br/>  This roadsign of yours totally baffles me but I guess it must be in use somewhere; I like kittens and apples, but because you have focus issues, I''ll have to mark it down a bit.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-09 00:07:58.</i></td>', 'What? What? What? What country has roadsigns like this? What does it mean? What were you thinking? What? What? What?   Okay, in Japan there are road construction signs with photos of flowers and animals, and cartoon drawings of animals (I almost took a shot of an elephant yesterday), but always accompanied by text.  This roadsign of yours totally baffles me but I guess it must be in use somewhere; I like kittens and apples, but because you have focus issues, I''ll have to mark it down a bit.', '2005-02-02 00:38:19.000000', '2005-02-09 00:07:58.000000', 1),
(1145394, 141309, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-11 21:19:54.</i></td>', 'z', '2005-02-02 00:39:14.000000', '2005-07-11 22:19:54.000000', 1),
