(1145521, 141753, 31213, '<td valign="top">Sign is interesting.  Composition is great.  Overall nice job.</td>', 'Sign is interesting.  Composition is great.  Overall nice job.', '2005-02-02 01:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145523, 141569, 31213, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Very nice.  7', '2005-02-02 01:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145527, 141594, 31213, '<td valign="top">Lots of uninteresting visual "debri" in the background of this photo.  The sign is interesting but a little dull.  Probably didn''t use a flash, and not enough post processing.  The best thing you ahve going for you are the mountains in the background.  Wish you would have cropped out the powerlines.....</td>', 'Lots of uninteresting visual "debri" in the background of this photo.  The sign is interesting but a little dull.  Probably didn''t use a flash, and not enough post processing.  The best thing you ahve going for you are the mountains in the background.  Wish you would have cropped out the powerlines.....', '2005-02-02 01:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145529, 141954, 31213, '<td valign="top">This would be a little stronger if there was more contract between the sign and the trees.  The image as a whole has a very "flat" feel to it.  Perhaps intentional...?</td>', 'This would be a little stronger if there was more contract between the sign and the trees.  The image as a whole has a very "flat" feel to it.  Perhaps intentional...?', '2005-02-02 01:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145530, 141667, 31213, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft.  Plus, which sign is your "subject"?  Visually not composed to its full potential.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft.  Plus, which sign is your "subject"?  Visually not composed to its full potential.', '2005-02-02 01:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145531, 142419, 19790, '<td valign="top">I think the problem here is that you''re relying on the sign plus your title to explain your picture. However, that would require an understanding of the language this sign is in, which most viewers don''t have. If I''m mistaken I appologize, but I don''t think this worked.</td>', 'I think the problem here is that you''re relying on the sign plus your title to explain your picture. However, that would require an understanding of the language this sign is in, which most viewers don''t have. If I''m mistaken I appologize, but I don''t think this worked.', '2005-02-02 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145533, 140883, 31213, '<td valign="top">Those are lights not signs!  Perhaps it can be up for interpretation...I''ll give you that.  Afterall, they are giving you a "message".  Composition is very nice.  Not a fan of the yellow X in the background though.</td>', 'Those are lights not signs!  Perhaps it can be up for interpretation...I''ll give you that.  Afterall, they are giving you a "message".  Composition is very nice.  Not a fan of the yellow X in the background though.', '2005-02-02 01:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
