(1145988, 141144, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the way everything but the sign is silhouetted and how vibrant the RR sign is but whith such a high contrast I find it very hard to look at.  I also find that there is something in the middle of the sign that is very distracting.  Great color and clarity and awesome silohouettes.  well done and keep up the good work. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I like the way everything but the sign is silhouetted and how vibrant the RR sign is but whith such a high contrast I find it very hard to look at.  I also find that there is something in the middle of the sign that is very distracting.  Great color and clarity and awesome silohouettes.  well done and keep up the good work. <7>', '2005-02-02 07:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145992, 141838, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and I like the B&amp;W look but its not level.  The island should be level don''t you think?  I also would have liked to see the "ONE WAY" sign more in focus.  I realy like the detail in the island and find it to have excellent sharpness and contrast for such a gloomy sky.  Good luck in the challenge. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot and I like the B&W look but its not level.  The island should be level don''t you think?  I also would have liked to see the "ONE WAY" sign more in focus.  I realy like the detail in the island and find it to have excellent sharpness and contrast for such a gloomy sky.  Good luck in the challenge. <6>', '2005-02-02 07:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145993, 142417, 31282, '<td valign="top">lol well done ! Shame it''s too little....</td>', 'lol well done ! Shame it''s too little....', '2005-02-02 07:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1145994, 142520, 17047, '<td valign="top">I really like your viewpoint.</td>', 'I really like your viewpoint.', '2005-02-02 07:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
