(1146011, 141824, 14671, '<td valign="top">Good shot but I find it lacks crispness.  It looks like the contrast is a little to bright which is giving a blurry look to the whole picture.  It may also be the white balance.  I like the crop and positioning of the shot.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Good shot but I find it lacks crispness.  It looks like the contrast is a little to bright which is giving a blurry look to the whole picture.  It may also be the white balance.  I like the crop and positioning of the shot.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-02 07:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
