(1146019, 141788, 14671, '<td valign="top">Great signs but its not the clearest shot I''ve seen.  I find there''s a lot of noise in the shot but it is level which I find a lot of photos in this challenge aren''t.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Great signs but its not the clearest shot I''ve seen.  I find there''s a lot of noise in the shot but it is level which I find a lot of photos in this challenge aren''t.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-02 07:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
