(1146091, 142366, 24890, '<td valign="top">If this were my photo I would remove the sign just above the couples head. Judging by the framing you have done, there must have been a very distracting element on the left....maybe a window... so you couldn''t have shot it more to the left. But shooting it more to the right would have messed up the sign that is high on the left. So cloning out that sign above the couple would have worked best. 5</td>', 'If this were my photo I would remove the sign just above the couples head. Judging by the framing you have done, there must have been a very distracting element on the left....maybe a window... so you couldn''t have shot it more to the left. But shooting it more to the right would have messed up the sign that is high on the left. So cloning out that sign above the couple would have worked best. 5', '2005-02-02 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146093, 141279, 24890, '<td valign="top">I like how the red of the ice sign seems to jump out of this picture with beautiful colors. 7</td>', 'I like how the red of the ice sign seems to jump out of this picture with beautiful colors. 7', '2005-02-02 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
