(1146879, 142067, 31865, '<td valign="top">the composition needs some work.  why did you cut off the sign?  i think if you could have gotten a higher angle and positioned the sign slightly further to the left, and waited for the ducks to come closer into the frame, it would have been better.   Also the lighting is kind of dull making the photo appear flat.  Maybe a sunset in the background would have made this fit the sign better.  Too bad there''s a power line there.  I know you can''t help that, though.</td>', 'the composition needs some work.  why did you cut off the sign?  i think if you could have gotten a higher angle and positioned the sign slightly further to the left, and waited for the ducks to come closer into the frame, it would have been better.   Also the lighting is kind of dull making the photo appear flat.  Maybe a sunset in the background would have made this fit the sign better.  Too bad there''s a power line there.  I know you can''t help that, though.', '2005-02-02 13:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1146882, 141097, 31865, '<td valign="top">I like the beat up sign, (how do they get that way?) but i think it would have been better in some sort of context, and without being so centered.  The tones in the sign are nice, but the background makes it boring.</td>', 'I like the beat up sign, (how do they get that way?) but i think it would have been better in some sort of context, and without being so centered.  The tones in the sign are nice, but the background makes it boring.', '2005-02-02 13:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
