(1147345, 141631, 14735, '<td valign="top">I love the color against the grey sky, well done</td>', 'I love the color against the grey sky, well done', '2005-02-02 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147347, 141954, 5792, '<td valign="top">The idea for this image is OK, but the execution is not so good. It looks as though it has had Neatimage applied poorly and that it is oversharpened.  Both combine making the image poor quality. Positioning the main subject (the sign) in one of the rule of thirds intersection points would improve the composition.</td>', 'The idea for this image is OK, but the execution is not so good. It looks as though it has had Neatimage applied poorly and that it is oversharpened.  Both combine making the image poor quality. Positioning the main subject (the sign) in one of the rule of thirds intersection points would improve the composition.', '2005-02-02 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147357, 142507, 5792, '<td valign="top">The composition is excellent, but the general quality of the image is not very good. The signs and other lines suffer digitalization and haloing and hash marks and the color seems to clipped, perhaps due to post processing.</td>', 'The composition is excellent, but the general quality of the image is not very good. The signs and other lines suffer digitalization and haloing and hash marks and the color seems to clipped, perhaps due to post processing.', '2005-02-02 17:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147361, 142604, 14735, '<td valign="top">There is too much in this picture, you should have zoomed in more on the subject. The topic of the challenge is lost in the mountain view and other background which do nothing for the photo. Keep shooting</td>', 'There is too much in this picture, you should have zoomed in more on the subject. The topic of the challenge is lost in the mountain view and other background which do nothing for the photo. Keep shooting', '2005-02-02 17:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
