(1147487, 142598, 32749, '<td valign="top">LOL, good work all round.</td>', 'LOL, good work all round.', '2005-02-02 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147497, 141475, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The colour and focus shift in the top right corner feels strange.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened? -7</td>', 'I like the composition.  The colour and focus shift in the top right corner feels strange.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened? -7', '2005-02-02 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147498, 142714, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition and a bit of luck with blue sky and some clouds to add some balance and you have got a pretty damn good picture (10)</td>', 'Nice, simple composition and a bit of luck with blue sky and some clouds to add some balance and you have got a pretty damn good picture (10)', '2005-02-02 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147502, 141521, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very original.  Good composition and colour.  One of a very few images that has a mood to it.  A very poetic title. <br/>Good work.  (9)</td>', 'Very original.  Good composition and colour.  One of a very few images that has a mood to it.  A very poetic title. Good work.  (9)', '2005-02-02 18:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147505, 142124, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  Perhaps a lower or a higher viewpoint would have made a greater impact.</td>', 'A good idea.  Perhaps a lower or a higher viewpoint would have made a greater impact.', '2005-02-02 18:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147508, 142037, 24642, '<td valign="top">Strong balanced composition with a nice flow.  One of a few images in the challange that the roadsign really fits the image.  (9)</td>', 'Strong balanced composition with a nice flow.  One of a few images in the challange that the roadsign really fits the image.  (9)', '2005-02-02 18:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147511, 142717, 2022, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this picture relates to the challenge. And then, it seems to be out of focus and the lighting is problematic. Sorry (1)</td>', 'I am not sure how this picture relates to the challenge. And then, it seems to be out of focus and the lighting is problematic. Sorry (1)', '2005-02-02 18:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147513, 141404, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice work with movement and reflections.</td>', 'Nice work with movement and reflections.', '2005-02-02 18:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147515, 140907, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Love it (because of your title)!</td>', 'ROFL! Love it (because of your title)!', '2005-02-02 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147517, 142502, 24642, '<td valign="top">Funky.  <br/>Would a tighter crop at the top and bottom increase the impact? (6)</td>', 'Funky.  Would a tighter crop at the top and bottom increase the impact? (6)', '2005-02-02 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147518, 142322, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but the border makes it look like clip art, in my opinion. There''s a lot of "artifacts" around the post &amp; sign, which is from  overcompression - the file size is only about 18K, but it can be up to 150K. Great effort though, i still like it a lot.</td>', 'Great shot, but the border makes it look like clip art, in my opinion. There''s a lot of "artifacts" around the post & sign, which is from  overcompression - the file size is only about 18K, but it can be up to 150K. Great effort though, i still like it a lot.', '2005-02-02 18:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147520, 142714, 24642, '<td valign="top">I would have liked some more sky at the top.  Otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I would have liked some more sky at the top.  Otherwise a nice shot.', '2005-02-02 18:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147524, 142661, 25218, '<td valign="top">$351, huh.. those $1 must really add up! Great point of view, nice colors.</td>', '$351, huh.. those $1 must really add up! Great point of view, nice colors.', '2005-02-02 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147525, 142221, 24642, '<td valign="top">One of a very few that makes sense outside the challenge.  Nice use of space.  Beautiful flow and shadows in the building.  A slight clockwise rotate would have straightened the sign.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened?  (9)</td>', 'One of a very few that makes sense outside the challenge.  Nice use of space.  Beautiful flow and shadows in the building.  A slight clockwise rotate would have straightened the sign.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened?  (9)', '2005-02-02 18:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147526, 142661, 2022, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture with nice and simple composition, good colors (10)</td>', 'Interesting picture with nice and simple composition, good colors (10)', '2005-02-02 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147529, 142086, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and decent composition but somehow I think that some more space to the right or to the top would help.  -8</td>', 'Nice colours and decent composition but somehow I think that some more space to the right or to the top would help.  -8', '2005-02-02 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147530, 142121, 5354, '<td valign="top">I know where this is. I used to wrok in Belper, just down the road ;-)</td>', 'I know where this is. I used to wrok in Belper, just down the road ;-)', '2005-02-02 18:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147533, 142342, 25218, '<td valign="top">Ha! Arrest those people! I love how the woman in the bottom left corner is staring at the camera - reminds me of the little girl in that "Sunday In the Park" painting by Seurralt (i don''t know the real name). Photo is nicely exposed, considering the overcast white sky, and the humor is well-observed. Good job!</td>', 'Ha! Arrest those people! I love how the woman in the bottom left corner is staring at the camera - reminds me of the little girl in that "Sunday In the Park" painting by Seurralt (i don''t know the real name). Photo is nicely exposed, considering the overcast white sky, and the humor is well-observed. Good job!', '2005-02-02 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147540, 140907, 5354, '<td valign="top">Oh my god is that for real?<br/>Fantastic irony ;-)</td>', 'Oh my god is that for real?Fantastic irony ;-)', '2005-02-02 18:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
