(1147705, 141189, 18367, '<td valign="top">I did get a chuckle out of this one, (actually gut splitting laughter is more appropriate).  Very well done,  Good luck to you with the challenge.</td>', 'I did get a chuckle out of this one, (actually gut splitting laughter is more appropriate).  Very well done,  Good luck to you with the challenge.', '2005-02-02 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
