(1147989, 142360, 31541, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  Don''t know how close you were, but I think I''d like it better if the sign started at the bottom of the picture and the top had more sky.</td>', 'Nice idea!  Don''t know how close you were, but I think I''d like it better if the sign started at the bottom of the picture and the top had more sky.', '2005-02-02 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147991, 141281, 25946, '<td valign="top">There is a stop sign at the end of the bridge to nowhere.  What a cool shot!!</td>', 'There is a stop sign at the end of the bridge to nowhere.  What a cool shot!!', '2005-02-02 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147993, 142661, 25946, '<td valign="top">The colors are great..  I like the angle as well.</td>', 'The colors are great..  I like the angle as well.', '2005-02-02 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147995, 142441, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting road sign to say the least.  One can only assume that it from a fatal accident.  Nice composition and great colors.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting road sign to say the least.  One can only assume that it from a fatal accident.  Nice composition and great colors.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-02 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147996, 142738, 25946, '<td valign="top">This is a very great sign.  I have never seen anything like it. Love the tress and the castle..  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a very great sign.  I have never seen anything like it. Love the tress and the castle..  Good luck.', '2005-02-02 23:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1147999, 141186, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desaturation but the contrast on the B&amp;W is a little to harsh.  Perhaps it is the snow.  I also find the the image has a lot of noise in it.  Great positioning on the sign tho.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice selective desaturation but the contrast on the B&W is a little to harsh.  Perhaps it is the snow.  I also find the the image has a lot of noise in it.  Great positioning on the sign tho.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-02 23:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148000, 142205, 25946, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh.  Great sign..</td>', 'This one made me laugh.  Great sign..', '2005-02-02 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148002, 141610, 14671, '<td valign="top">Its only a sign.  There is no substance other then the stop sign in this photo and in my opinion makes for a fairly boring picture.  Perhaps if it were a straight on shot or something similar.  Good luck on this challenge.</td>', 'Its only a sign.  There is no substance other then the stop sign in this photo and in my opinion makes for a fairly boring picture.  Perhaps if it were a straight on shot or something similar.  Good luck on this challenge.', '2005-02-02 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148007, 142405, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge but the clarity  leaves a lot to be desired.  Its also hard to tell what kind of sign it is and what purpose it has without any surrounding environment. Good luck on this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge but the clarity  leaves a lot to be desired.  Its also hard to tell what kind of sign it is and what purpose it has without any surrounding environment. Good luck on this challenge.', '2005-02-02 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148011, 141542, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like it.  This says to me "hammer down and lets see how fast we can hit the corner".  The clarity leaves a lot to be desired but it does have nice contrast and isn''t to bright.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I like it.  This says to me "hammer down and lets see how fast we can hit the corner".  The clarity leaves a lot to be desired but it does have nice contrast and isn''t to bright.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-02 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148015, 141470, 25946, '<td valign="top">This one took me a moment to figure out but I get it!!   Nice Shot..  A little busy since I was distracted by the cars at first.  What a funny sign..  :)</td>', 'This one took me a moment to figure out but I get it!!   Nice Shot..  A little busy since I was distracted by the cars at first.  What a funny sign..  :)', '2005-02-02 23:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
