(1148127, 141516, 25261, '<td valign="top">Basic editing?</td>', 'Basic editing?', '2005-02-03 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148146, 142494, 19831, '<td valign="top">Creative intrepretation. Makes an interesting abstract, I think.</td>', 'Creative intrepretation. Makes an interesting abstract, I think.', '2005-02-03 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148160, 141542, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I find this photo interesting. At the initial look, it seems kind of bland, however, upon further study, I find my eye pleasantly following the lines of the road (especially the yellow line) across the photo. I''m not sure if it is your intent, but the lines lead my eye to the road intersection, and then strongly drawn to the yellow sign there at the corner. Unfortunately, I think many may not give this the time to appreciate the subtleness of it. Nice job IMO.</td>', 'Hmmm, I find this photo interesting. At the initial look, it seems kind of bland, however, upon further study, I find my eye pleasantly following the lines of the road (especially the yellow line) across the photo. I''m not sure if it is your intent, but the lines lead my eye to the road intersection, and then strongly drawn to the yellow sign there at the corner. Unfortunately, I think many may not give this the time to appreciate the subtleness of it. Nice job IMO.', '2005-02-03 01:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148165, 142131, 14476, '<td valign="top">I think of this as more of a woodland scene than a fallow field, but the weathered tractor / driver sign is a good one.  Perhaps in a different setting it would do even better, or with a different title.  I love the brook in the background. Hope you have lots of fun playing with compositions based on it...</td>', 'I think of this as more of a woodland scene than a fallow field, but the weathered tractor / driver sign is a good one.  Perhaps in a different setting it would do even better, or with a different title.  I love the brook in the background. Hope you have lots of fun playing with compositions based on it...', '2005-02-03 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148167, 141591, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed.  I do wonder if the slanted perspective of the image works for this Challenge.   But it does tell a good story.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed.  I do wonder if the slanted perspective of the image works for this Challenge.   But it does tell a good story.', '2005-02-03 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148168, 141475, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Obviously very nice lines. Makes for a good abstract, IMO.</td>', 'Interesting. Obviously very nice lines. Makes for a good abstract, IMO.', '2005-02-03 01:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148171, 142193, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, you might get ''marked down'' for lack of a Road Sign, but this is a lovely photograph with muted colors and that perfect fence leading one down the path.  Serene and pleasant.</td>', 'Well, you might get ''marked down'' for lack of a Road Sign, but this is a lovely photograph with muted colors and that perfect fence leading one down the path.  Serene and pleasant.', '2005-02-03 01:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148175, 141703, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Like the dof. Nice job on the b/w.</td>', 'Nice composition. Like the dof. Nice job on the b/w.', '2005-02-03 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148177, 142218, 14476, '<td valign="top">You chose a historic spot for your entry.  It might have packed a bit more "Wow" factor if you''d been able to capture a nice bright red truck to temper the quiet tones you have in this image.  I like the title as well.</td>', 'You chose a historic spot for your entry.  It might have packed a bit more "Wow" factor if you''d been able to capture a nice bright red truck to temper the quiet tones you have in this image.  I like the title as well.', '2005-02-03 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148185, 142406, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Nice tones, and I find the selective desat works well in this case. Good job.</td>', 'Nice composition. Nice tones, and I find the selective desat works well in this case. Good job.', '2005-02-03 01:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148190, 142124, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and hope it does well.  Good lighting as well as good composition.</td>', 'I like this a lot and hope it does well.  Good lighting as well as good composition.', '2005-02-03 01:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148193, 142538, 14476, '<td valign="top">every color in this very nice composition works.  Very well done.</td>', 'every color in this very nice composition works.  Very well done.', '2005-02-03 01:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148195, 141972, 14476, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is clever,fun and I hope it does well.  (but) you know, the S with the slash through it looks a lot like a $ sign.  You could have fun with this sign sans stop sign, with the right props.   Well, hold the thought until next year. <br/> :&gt;)  <br/>Meanwhile, good luck.</td>', 'Okay, this is clever,fun and I hope it does well.  (but) you know, the S with the slash through it looks a lot like a $ sign.  You could have fun with this sign sans stop sign, with the right props.   Well, hold the thought until next year.  :>)  Meanwhile, good luck.', '2005-02-03 01:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148196, 142417, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really, really, like the fun in this image of the sign and the acting out with the umbrella.  You will go far in DP Challenge if you can figure out how to make your images fit the DP size.  Meanwhile, I''ll give you a big pat on the back for a fine sense of humor.</td>', 'I really, really, like the fun in this image of the sign and the acting out with the umbrella.  You will go far in DP Challenge if you can figure out how to make your images fit the DP size.  Meanwhile, I''ll give you a big pat on the back for a fine sense of humor.', '2005-02-03 01:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148200, 141657, 32768, '<td valign="top">My roundabout has more signs.  It has twenty. nice picture!</td>', 'My roundabout has more signs.  It has twenty. nice picture!', '2005-02-03 01:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148207, 142123, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the way you took an angle here with the sign really pointing to the square (or part of the square).  I think you may get marked off a bit for people not thinking that this is a true "roadside" sign.  Good job though.</td>', 'I like the way you took an angle here with the sign really pointing to the square (or part of the square).  I think you may get marked off a bit for people not thinking that this is a true "roadside" sign.  Good job though.', '2005-02-03 02:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148209, 142732, 31214, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  A 10 from me.', '2005-02-03 02:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148212, 141631, 31214, '<td valign="top">The angle you take this shot commands authority.  I really like the colors too....and that sky is really nice.  Even the pole is so new.  This sign can''t be more than 48 hours old!  nice going....9</td>', 'The angle you take this shot commands authority.  I really like the colors too....and that sky is really nice.  Even the pole is so new.  This sign can''t be more than 48 hours old!  nice going....9', '2005-02-03 02:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148214, 142668, 31214, '<td valign="top">Best STOP sign in the competition and there are quite a few.  I love the close-up treatment and the edge-out cropping.  I gave it a 9!  Well done.</td>', 'Best STOP sign in the competition and there are quite a few.  I love the close-up treatment and the edge-out cropping.  I gave it a 9!  Well done.', '2005-02-03 02:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148217, 142538, 31214, '<td valign="top">A lot of these time-lapse car light shots but yours is the best.  I especially like the simplicity of yours combined with the addition of yellow inside lights.  Your arrows signs illuminate nicely   A 9 from me.  Nice job!</td>', 'A lot of these time-lapse car light shots but yours is the best.  I especially like the simplicity of yours combined with the addition of yellow inside lights.  Your arrows signs illuminate nicely   A 9 from me.  Nice job!', '2005-02-03 02:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148218, 142335, 14671, '<td valign="top">The contrast on this photo seems extremely bright.  I also find the border is to big and the clarity is OoF.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The contrast on this photo seems extremely bright.  I also find the border is to big and the clarity is OoF.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-02-03 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148219, 142102, 31214, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colors here.  Very original idea.  This photo is REALLY strong and it speaks volumes!  Well done...a mastery!</td>', 'I love the muted colors here.  Very original idea.  This photo is REALLY strong and it speaks volumes!  Well done...a mastery!', '2005-02-03 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
