(1148727, 141483, 19066, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast of the main sign against the mountain.  would be more effective if the horizon was straightened for that sign and possibly some of the bottom cropped out.</td>', 'i like the contrast of the main sign against the mountain.  would be more effective if the horizon was straightened for that sign and possibly some of the bottom cropped out.', '2005-02-03 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148729, 141163, 14476, '<td valign="top">I dearly love this image.  (Wonder if it''s somewhere in Hawaii? - I know, I''ll find out when the Challenge is over)  Anyhow, the Stop Sign in all its flowery glory is your story.  Consider zooming in, getting even lower, or otherwise changing your angle to bring out this beauty and avoid the distraction of the houses and clutter in the background.</td>', 'I dearly love this image.  (Wonder if it''s somewhere in Hawaii? - I know, I''ll find out when the Challenge is over)  Anyhow, the Stop Sign in all its flowery glory is your story.  Consider zooming in, getting even lower, or otherwise changing your angle to bring out this beauty and avoid the distraction of the houses and clutter in the background.', '2005-02-03 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148730, 142205, 19066, '<td valign="top">blurry :(</td>', 'blurry :(', '2005-02-03 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148732, 142331, 27845, '<td valign="top">Crude humour....7.</td>', 'Crude humour....7.', '2005-02-03 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148735, 140988, 14476, '<td valign="top">Graceful curves and the sweep of the mountain clearly hold this image together.  What would help this nice picture would be a nice splash of bright color somewhere in the composition.  A helpful car would work, or a person in a red coat near the bridge...  you get the idea.  Keep working, you have a good eye for composition.</td>', 'Graceful curves and the sweep of the mountain clearly hold this image together.  What would help this nice picture would be a nice splash of bright color somewhere in the composition.  A helpful car would work, or a person in a red coat near the bridge...  you get the idea.  Keep working, you have a good eye for composition.', '2005-02-03 11:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148737, 142600, 27845, '<td valign="top">The contrast is too harsh for me, but for the rest this shot works very well. 9.</td>', 'The contrast is too harsh for me, but for the rest this shot works very well. 9.', '2005-02-03 11:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148740, 142604, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice play with words. The sky looks strange because of the way you cropped it with the mountains. You should have cropped away all of the white area. 6.</td>', 'Nice play with words. The sky looks strange because of the way you cropped it with the mountains. You should have cropped away all of the white area. 6.', '2005-02-03 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148741, 142427, 14476, '<td valign="top">I expect you''ll get ''dinged'' for not having a visible road sign in your composition, but I just have to tell you that there is a very pleasing image here with good sky and that slash of blue to draw visual interest.  Nicely balanced.</td>', 'I expect you''ll get ''dinged'' for not having a visible road sign in your composition, but I just have to tell you that there is a very pleasing image here with good sky and that slash of blue to draw visual interest.  Nicely balanced.', '2005-02-03 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148742, 141631, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting...the only thing missing is a lightning hitting the sign :) 10.</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting...the only thing missing is a lightning hitting the sign :) 10.', '2005-02-03 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148746, 142598, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lol...you took a second look, huh? I like the irony, but the plant in the background is somewhat distracting. 8.</td>', 'Lol...you took a second look, huh? I like the irony, but the plant in the background is somewhat distracting. 8.', '2005-02-03 11:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148748, 141061, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a very funny image and nicely composed.  It''s a bit lacking in punch, perhaps because it may be a bit overexposed.  When I get in this kind of situation, I tend to bracket my shots.  Anyhow, this is a good find andgave me a chuckle.<br/>;&gt;)</td>', 'This is a very funny image and nicely composed.  It''s a bit lacking in punch, perhaps because it may be a bit overexposed.  When I get in this kind of situation, I tend to bracket my shots.  Anyhow, this is a good find andgave me a chuckle.;>)', '2005-02-03 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148752, 141838, 27845, '<td valign="top">Why did you not call it ''One way in, no way out''? I think that would have fit better. The idea is great, the only problem is that the sign is slightly out of focus. 7.</td>', 'Why did you not call it ''One way in, no way out''? I think that would have fit better. The idea is great, the only problem is that the sign is slightly out of focus. 7.', '2005-02-03 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148756, 141834, 14476, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, I think I know this intersection... No, just one like it.   The sign is great, and it took good seeing (and a handy place to park) to get it.  Probably the topography was too difficult to get the sign and the road, rather than the sign and the building, but you might also consider getting low and isolating the sign against that beautiful blue sky.   Still, it''s a good image and looks as if you had fun getting it.</td>', 'Hmmmm, I think I know this intersection... No, just one like it.   The sign is great, and it took good seeing (and a handy place to park) to get it.  Probably the topography was too difficult to get the sign and the road, rather than the sign and the building, but you might also consider getting low and isolating the sign against that beautiful blue sky.   Still, it''s a good image and looks as if you had fun getting it.', '2005-02-03 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148757, 142710, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but it''s much, much too small. Even with a 1MP camera you should get larger pictures...Well, the guiding lines save you: 7.</td>', 'A nice picture, but it''s much, much too small. Even with a 1MP camera you should get larger pictures...Well, the guiding lines save you: 7.', '2005-02-03 11:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148761, 142249, 14476, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting, moody picture.  You show off the arches well.  If it was mine, I''d probably try cropping to get rid of that 1/2 sign to the right and maybe crop a little tighter at the top to just include the train - losing the wires and rays.  It just seems to me the story is in the arches, train and sign.   But you captured a fine image under difficult conditions.</td>', 'this is an interesting, moody picture.  You show off the arches well.  If it was mine, I''d probably try cropping to get rid of that 1/2 sign to the right and maybe crop a little tighter at the top to just include the train - losing the wires and rays.  It just seems to me the story is in the arches, train and sign.   But you captured a fine image under difficult conditions.', '2005-02-03 11:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148765, 142427, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition, very soft and harmonic. I like the lines and shadows, only the ground on the right side is a little distracting. Nonetheless: 10.</td>', 'Great colours and composition, very soft and harmonic. I like the lines and shadows, only the ground on the right side is a little distracting. Nonetheless: 10.', '2005-02-03 11:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148769, 141629, 27845, '<td valign="top">It''s strange the war between North and South Korea is called ''The Forgotten War''. We studied it a month ago in school... I don''t know what it is, but this picture has something special I cannot determine. 8.</td>', 'It''s strange the war between North and South Korea is called ''The Forgotten War''. We studied it a month ago in school... I don''t know what it is, but this picture has something special I cannot determine. 8.', '2005-02-03 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
