(1148796, 142481, 19066, '<td valign="top">hey, i recognize that sign!  east end of robert moses state park... :)  a nice tight crop may have brought it out more.</td>', 'hey, i recognize that sign!  east end of robert moses state park... :)  a nice tight crop may have brought it out more.', '2005-02-03 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148802, 142037, 19066, '<td valign="top">The imperfection in the black of the arrow (sign''s fault, not yours...) is a little distracting and takes away from what is otherwise one of the best of the bunch I''ve seen so far.  Great composition, great contrast between the sign and elevated roadway, and the color of the sky does exactly what it should as a backdrop.  Very nice.</td>', 'The imperfection in the black of the arrow (sign''s fault, not yours...) is a little distracting and takes away from what is otherwise one of the best of the bunch I''ve seen so far.  Great composition, great contrast between the sign and elevated roadway, and the color of the sky does exactly what it should as a backdrop.  Very nice.', '2005-02-03 11:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148809, 141956, 31443, '<td valign="top">This has got to be Scalvert!</td>', 'This has got to be Scalvert!', '2005-02-03 11:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148811, 142102, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot and great idea, I am sure some people will think it´s off topic but I am not one of them.  Only thing I don´t like about it is that IMO it´s cropped a little tight around the girl, gives off a sort of claustrophobic feel, probably what you were going for but I think I would have liked a slightly wider shot better.<br/> <br/>Anyway, good shot, I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Good shot and great idea, I am sure some people will think it´s off topic but I am not one of them.  Only thing I don´t like about it is that IMO it´s cropped a little tight around the girl, gives off a sort of claustrophobic feel, probably what you were going for but I think I would have liked a slightly wider shot better. Anyway, good shot, I gave it an 8.', '2005-02-03 11:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
