(1148867, 141568, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is almost surreal in quality, especially with the background figures echoing the big sign.  My first impression (for what it''s worth) when I saw this image was:  Hey, he''s walking on piano keys! Anyhow, it''s good seeing and a nice image - maybe a bit overexposed at the bottom, but still, fun.</td>', 'This is almost surreal in quality, especially with the background figures echoing the big sign.  My first impression (for what it''s worth) when I saw this image was:  Hey, he''s walking on piano keys! Anyhow, it''s good seeing and a nice image - maybe a bit overexposed at the bottom, but still, fun.', '2005-02-03 12:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148873, 141279, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot with good colours but did you include yourself in the frame for some reason?  I try my hardest to avoid my own shadow, I would have rotated about 5 degrees to the left or just plain cropped it out because it really bugs the hell out of me, sorry :o)<br/> <br/>Anyway, the shot itself is good, at least way above average in the competition, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Good shot with good colours but did you include yourself in the frame for some reason?  I try my hardest to avoid my own shadow, I would have rotated about 5 degrees to the left or just plain cropped it out because it really bugs the hell out of me, sorry :o) Anyway, the shot itself is good, at least way above average in the competition, gave it a 7.', '2005-02-03 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
