(1148876, 142331, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad the basic rules prohibit this as a little burning of the grass (not literally of course) in photoshop would have really nailed this shot for me personally.  Anyway, good job and what an odd sign, after the challenge is over I am going back to see where this is taken.</td>', 'Too bad the basic rules prohibit this as a little burning of the grass (not literally of course) in photoshop would have really nailed this shot for me personally.  Anyway, good job and what an odd sign, after the challenge is over I am going back to see where this is taken.', '2005-02-03 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1148879, 141281, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, my goodness, that''s not something to brag about, is it!  Great find.  The stop sign at the end of the bridge might be a candidate for the next one of these challenges.   I like the low-key approach you took to this composition.</td>', 'Well, my goodness, that''s not something to brag about, is it!  Great find.  The stop sign at the end of the bridge might be a candidate for the next one of these challenges.   I like the low-key approach you took to this composition.', '2005-02-03 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
