(1148988, 142569, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really cool subject/location.  Great find.  I certainly understand why you didn''t do it, but the composition might have been improved if it were from a "drivers" perspective -- i.e. the middle of the road.  Heh... reminds me of some towns in Texas where I''ve been busted for speeding... you ain''t from araaahnd heah aaah yuh?</td>', 'Really cool subject/location.  Great find.  I certainly understand why you didn''t do it, but the composition might have been improved if it were from a "drivers" perspective -- i.e. the middle of the road.  Heh... reminds me of some towns in Texas where I''ve been busted for speeding... you ain''t from araaahnd heah aaah yuh?', '2005-02-03 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
