(1149001, 141475, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting play on the roadside theme, but is still within the bounds of reasonable interpretation. The diagonal composition gives good strength and dynamics. <br/> <br/>The loss in depth of field in the top right hand corner is a little distracting  but on the whole I feel this is an an inovative and interesting submission.<br/></td>', 'This is an interesting play on the roadside theme, but is still within the bounds of reasonable interpretation. The diagonal composition gives good strength and dynamics.  The loss in depth of field in the top right hand corner is a little distracting  but on the whole I feel this is an an inovative and interesting submission.', '2005-02-03 14:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
