(1149068, 141475, 31172, '<td valign="top">Where''s the sign????  I''m gonna give you the benefit of the doubt and imagine that you are thinking of sign as this "a mark having a conventional meaning and used in place of words or to represent a complex notion" Good, creative, but I think many will misunderstand.<br/> <br/>Addition: You had to email me and tell me that it was a crosswalk. That''s hilarious that you think it could be misconstrued as anything but a crosswalk.  Good luck.<br/> <br/>Also this image would look better without the blue ghosting in the upper right hand corner.</td>', 'Where''s the sign????  I''m gonna give you the benefit of the doubt and imagine that you are thinking of sign as this "a mark having a conventional meaning and used in place of words or to represent a complex notion" Good, creative, but I think many will misunderstand. Addition: You had to email me and tell me that it was a crosswalk. That''s hilarious that you think it could be misconstrued as anything but a crosswalk.  Good luck. Also this image would look better without the blue ghosting in the upper right hand corner.', '2005-02-03 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
