(1150265, 142711, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea!  This actually makes me think for a minute and that isn´t all too common on this site.  Only thing is I think you could have lit the cross itself better, the lighting is too harsh and I guess you used a flash for this.  I would have used a flashlight to "paint" the cross with light, enabling you to control the shadows more.  The lighting drag it down from a 10 from me but I still gave you a 9 and it´s the highest from me so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome idea!  This actually makes me think for a minute and that isn´t all too common on this site.  Only thing is I think you could have lit the cross itself better, the lighting is too harsh and I guess you used a flash for this.  I would have used a flashlight to "paint" the cross with light, enabling you to control the shadows more.  The lighting drag it down from a 10 from me but I still gave you a 9 and it´s the highest from me so far in this challenge.', '2005-02-04 07:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
