(1150507, 142037, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition -- I really like the arc of the overpass.  The sign is a bit too saturated for my taste, and a shame you couldn''t clone out the big scratch in the sign due to basic editing rules.</td>', 'Beautiful composition -- I really like the arc of the overpass.  The sign is a bit too saturated for my taste, and a shame you couldn''t clone out the big scratch in the sign due to basic editing rules.', '2005-02-04 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
