(1150535, 141385, 18868, '<td valign="top">I think the ice is a dead giveaway.  LOL... The image is over-exposed: the light areas are entirely white, and the shadow areas are not dark enough.  You can''t fix the whites, but either levels or curves can help the shadows.</td>', 'I think the ice is a dead giveaway.  LOL... The image is over-exposed: the light areas are entirely white, and the shadow areas are not dark enough.  You can''t fix the whites, but either levels or curves can help the shadows.', '2005-02-04 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
