(1150715, 142237, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6<br/>Compsition: 5 Maybe another angle would have given it a better feel.<br/>Technical: 7 I like the bokeh effect and the halo outline of the sign.<br/>Appeal: 6 Just not giving me the wow that I want.<br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Challenge: 6Compsition: 5 Maybe another angle would have given it a better feel.Technical: 7 I like the bokeh effect and the halo outline of the sign.Appeal: 6 Just not giving me the wow that I want.Overall: 6', '2005-02-04 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150716, 142696, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find nothing here to *really* hold my interest. Is that really a road sign?</td>', 'I find nothing here to *really* hold my interest. Is that really a road sign?', '2005-02-04 14:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150720, 140485, 33103, '<td valign="top">oops</td>', 'oops', '2005-02-04 14:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150721, 142473, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the signs line up with the horizon, but the picture is way too small.</td>', 'I like the way that the signs line up with the horizon, but the picture is way too small.', '2005-02-04 14:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150722, 142248, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the trails from the car lights, but the sign is a little lost.</td>', 'I like the trails from the car lights, but the sign is a little lost.', '2005-02-04 14:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150725, 142335, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sign seems a little soft at the bottom.</td>', 'The sign seems a little soft at the bottom.', '2005-02-04 14:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150728, 141523, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely bright colours - fill flash on the sign?</td>', 'Lovely bright colours - fill flash on the sign?', '2005-02-04 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150730, 142509, 33103, '<td valign="top">hanging in there</td>', 'hanging in there', '2005-02-04 15:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150732, 141845, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that some contrast adjustments are necessary to bring the signs out. At the moment, they are a little lost in the background.</td>', 'I think that some contrast adjustments are necessary to bring the signs out. At the moment, they are a little lost in the background.', '2005-02-04 15:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150733, 142123, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 5<br/>Composition: 5 I just didnt like the background for this shot<br/>Technical: 7 I really like the way you angled the sign in the shot to give perspective.<br/>Appeal: 6 I bland background would have made this a nice shot.<br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Challenge: 5Composition: 5 I just didnt like the background for this shotTechnical: 7 I really like the way you angled the sign in the shot to give perspective.Appeal: 6 I bland background would have made this a nice shot.Overall: 6', '2005-02-04 15:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150735, 141956, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very amusing. I''d prefer to see a little more brightness in the background here.</td>', 'Very amusing. I''d prefer to see a little more brightness in the background here.', '2005-02-04 15:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150736, 141403, 24212, '<td valign="top">For this, I think that it would have been better photographed more straightly on, so that the perspective of the sign is not distorted. To me, the sign looks out of square.</td>', 'For this, I think that it would have been better photographed more straightly on, so that the perspective of the sign is not distorted. To me, the sign looks out of square.', '2005-02-04 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150740, 141214, 24212, '<td valign="top">Although the sky is bright and contrasty, the sign is too dark and the picture is too small.</td>', 'Although the sky is bright and contrasty, the sign is too dark and the picture is too small.', '2005-02-04 15:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150744, 142561, 33103, '<td valign="top">It reminds of Charles Dickens</td>', 'It reminds of Charles Dickens', '2005-02-04 15:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150745, 141244, 19405, '<td valign="top">I like the message</td>', 'I like the message', '2005-02-04 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150747, 142334, 33103, '<td valign="top">Which the water or the dog</td>', 'Which the water or the dog', '2005-02-04 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150756, 142332, 24212, '<td valign="top">For my tastes, the train is neither sharp enough nor blurred enough. It also seems a little dark.</td>', 'For my tastes, the train is neither sharp enough nor blurred enough. It also seems a little dark.', '2005-02-04 15:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150758, 142572, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the sign needs a little more illumination to make this picture really pop. I love the texture of the snow.</td>', 'I think that the sign needs a little more illumination to make this picture really pop. I love the texture of the snow.', '2005-02-04 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150759, 141923, 24212, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really scream road sign.</td>', 'This doesn''t really scream road sign.', '2005-02-04 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150761, 141186, 24212, '<td valign="top">Inventive desaturation, but the fence and the shed kill the mood somewhat.</td>', 'Inventive desaturation, but the fence and the shed kill the mood somewhat.', '2005-02-04 15:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150765, 142646, 24212, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit oversaturated, something that I find overpowers the rest of the photo.</td>', 'This seems a bit oversaturated, something that I find overpowers the rest of the photo.', '2005-02-04 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150767, 141677, 24212, '<td valign="top">The characters in the photo need to be more strongly lit. It would have been really smart if they had been carrying their boards on their heads, too.</td>', 'The characters in the photo need to be more strongly lit. It would have been really smart if they had been carrying their boards on their heads, too.', '2005-02-04 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150770, 141364, 24212, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that the sky is so uninteresting. The lighting is good and depth of field is great.</td>', 'It''s a pity that the sky is so uninteresting. The lighting is good and depth of field is great.', '2005-02-04 15:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150772, 141973, 24212, '<td valign="top">The overexposed sky and wall on the left are a little distracting.</td>', 'The overexposed sky and wall on the left are a little distracting.', '2005-02-04 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150773, 142448, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the sign and nicely out-of-focus background.</td>', 'Great texture on the sign and nicely out-of-focus background.', '2005-02-04 15:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150777, 142474, 24212, '<td valign="top">Amusing, but the lettering seems a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Amusing, but the lettering seems a little oversharpened.', '2005-02-04 15:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150781, 142577, 24212, '<td valign="top">This seems a little dark to me, but I love the depth of field and the relative lighting of the sign.</td>', 'This seems a little dark to me, but I love the depth of field and the relative lighting of the sign.', '2005-02-04 15:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150782, 141788, 33103, '<td valign="top">oh well</td>', 'oh well', '2005-02-04 15:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150784, 142731, 24212, '<td valign="top">I rather like this zoom effect. Perhaps a little noise reduction may help it along. Very striking.</td>', 'I rather like this zoom effect. Perhaps a little noise reduction may help it along. Very striking.', '2005-02-04 15:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150788, 141827, 24212, '<td valign="top">This might have been better not having so tight a crop, so that the viewer can see more of the converging lines.</td>', 'This might have been better not having so tight a crop, so that the viewer can see more of the converging lines.', '2005-02-04 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150797, 141185, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is just the sort of image that I can spend time just looking at, reading my own thoughts into. I love it.</td>', 'This is just the sort of image that I can spend time just looking at, reading my own thoughts into. I love it.', '2005-02-04 15:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150816, 142667, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the texture in the hand.</td>', 'Nice capture of the texture in the hand.', '2005-02-04 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150821, 141306, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that this would work better if the sign occupied slightly less of the frame.</td>', 'I think that this would work better if the sign occupied slightly less of the frame.', '2005-02-04 15:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150828, 142427, 24212, '<td valign="top">Dramatic photo, but it doesn''t really shout out ''road sign'' to me.</td>', 'Dramatic photo, but it doesn''t really shout out ''road sign'' to me.', '2005-02-04 15:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150831, 142168, 24212, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.', '2005-02-04 15:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150834, 141727, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, but there is no real ''centre'' to the image, other than the sign.</td>', 'Nicely lit, but there is no real ''centre'' to the image, other than the sign.', '2005-02-04 15:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150838, 142441, 24212, '<td valign="top">Strangely, the lamp post to the right seems to pop out and dominate unnecessarily.</td>', 'Strangely, the lamp post to the right seems to pop out and dominate unnecessarily.', '2005-02-04 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150844, 142620, 24212, '<td valign="top">I rather like the sharpness of the sign against the building. To nit-pick, I''d like to see the cross-member of the sign aligning with the horizontal elements of the building.</td>', 'I rather like the sharpness of the sign against the building. To nit-pick, I''d like to see the cross-member of the sign aligning with the horizontal elements of the building.', '2005-02-04 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150845, 141483, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very colourful, but I find this lacking a real point of interest.</td>', 'Very colourful, but I find this lacking a real point of interest.', '2005-02-04 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150846, 142722, 24212, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit.</td>', 'Beautifully lit.', '2005-02-04 16:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150850, 142334, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the cross component of the fence is aligned with the shoreline. The sky is wonderfully lit and I love this picture. I guess it''s because the fencing adds another layer to the seascape.</td>', 'I like the way that the cross component of the fence is aligned with the shoreline. The sky is wonderfully lit and I love this picture. I guess it''s because the fencing adds another layer to the seascape.', '2005-02-04 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150851, 141097, 24212, '<td valign="top">Good capture of texture, but I find little to hold my interest.</td>', 'Good capture of texture, but I find little to hold my interest.', '2005-02-04 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150857, 141643, 24212, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I like this shot, but I do.</td>', 'I don''t know why I like this shot, but I do.', '2005-02-04 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150860, 141279, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sign should be a little brighter and the picture should be a litle bigger. Good, contrasty shot with a lot of texture.</td>', 'The sign should be a little brighter and the picture should be a litle bigger. Good, contrasty shot with a lot of texture.', '2005-02-04 16:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150863, 142218, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and very sharp.</td>', 'Great depth of field and very sharp.', '2005-02-04 16:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150867, 140621, 24212, '<td valign="top">Reflection  and sign sharp - sky blurred - wonderful.</td>', 'Reflection  and sign sharp - sky blurred - wonderful.', '2005-02-04 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150871, 141404, 24212, '<td valign="top">Seeing a little more blue in the sky would really set this shot off.</td>', 'Seeing a little more blue in the sky would really set this shot off.', '2005-02-04 16:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150880, 140335, 24212, '<td valign="top">Are the trees really icy or is is a product of the shadows/highlights tool? Either way this is a really good shot that could benefit from a little more red channel saturation and a little more brightness in the sign.</td>', 'Are the trees really icy or is is a product of the shadows/highlights tool? Either way this is a really good shot that could benefit from a little more red channel saturation and a little more brightness in the sign.', '2005-02-04 16:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1150882, 142137, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely, fun image. Sharp, contrasty and saturated.</td>', 'A lovely, fun image. Sharp, contrasty and saturated.', '2005-02-04 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
