(1151805, 142426, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the red buildings behind spoil the effect somewhat. You''ve done well not to overexpose the snow on such a bright day.</td>', 'I think that the red buildings behind spoil the effect somewhat. You''ve done well not to overexpose the snow on such a bright day.', '2005-02-05 08:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
