(1151808, 142691, 24212, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that the sign is so blurred especially when the hillside is so sharp. From the title, I guess that''s what you were aiming for.</td>', 'It''s a pity that the sign is so blurred especially when the hillside is so sharp. From the title, I guess that''s what you were aiming for.', '2005-02-05 08:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
