(1152270, 141542, 24212, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but if the yellow saturation were to be turned up, the centre lines of the road would really stand out and offer a counterpoint to the sign.</td>', 'A nice shot, but if the yellow saturation were to be turned up, the centre lines of the road would really stand out and offer a counterpoint to the sign.', '2005-02-05 17:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152272, 141824, 24212, '<td valign="top">The car in the background is a little too in focus, thus drawing attention away from the sign.</td>', 'The car in the background is a little too in focus, thus drawing attention away from the sign.', '2005-02-05 17:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152274, 140593, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the building behind would look better if it were more out of focus.</td>', 'I think that the building behind would look better if it were more out of focus.', '2005-02-05 17:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152275, 142724, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but perhaps a little too dark overall for my tastes.</td>', 'Great idea, but perhaps a little too dark overall for my tastes.', '2005-02-05 17:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152276, 142715, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sky looks overexposed, which is a little distracting.</td>', 'The sky looks overexposed, which is a little distracting.', '2005-02-05 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152280, 141384, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can''t work out what the ghostly image at the top is. Is it intentional? The sign does not look ''clean'' enough against the background for me.</td>', 'I can''t work out what the ghostly image at the top is. Is it intentional? The sign does not look ''clean'' enough against the background for me.', '2005-02-05 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152281, 142005, 24212, '<td valign="top">Subject in the centre is not everyone''s taste. I quite like it but would perhaps like to see the saturation turned up to really bring out the sign.</td>', 'Subject in the centre is not everyone''s taste. I quite like it but would perhaps like to see the saturation turned up to really bring out the sign.', '2005-02-05 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152283, 142579, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very difficult lighting conditions, but I''d like to see the building a little brighter.</td>', 'Very difficult lighting conditions, but I''d like to see the building a little brighter.', '2005-02-05 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152287, 142461, 24212, '<td valign="top">Tremendously sharp. It''s a pity about the overexposure in the gantry signs, but it''s still a great picture.</td>', 'Tremendously sharp. It''s a pity about the overexposure in the gantry signs, but it''s still a great picture.', '2005-02-05 17:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152288, 141594, 24212, '<td valign="top">This would really benefit from some fill flash on the sign in my opinion.</td>', 'This would really benefit from some fill flash on the sign in my opinion.', '2005-02-05 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152290, 142356, 24212, '<td valign="top">Really dramatic. Road sign? Giving it a 7 anyway.</td>', 'Really dramatic. Road sign? Giving it a 7 anyway.', '2005-02-05 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152292, 142507, 24212, '<td valign="top">There appears to be a blob near the top left corner - is this perhaps dust on the sensor? To me, this picture is a bit too bright and slightly lacking in saturation.</td>', 'There appears to be a blob near the top left corner - is this perhaps dust on the sensor? To me, this picture is a bit too bright and slightly lacking in saturation.', '2005-02-05 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152323, 142417, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clever, but the picture is too small.</td>', 'Very clever, but the picture is too small.', '2005-02-05 18:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152325, 142673, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great, bright colours, but the sign appears too dark in comparison.</td>', 'Great, bright colours, but the sign appears too dark in comparison.', '2005-02-05 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152327, 141629, 24212, '<td valign="top">As sharp as anything, but I wonder if it would look better taken from a lower viewpoint, with only the mountains in the background.</td>', 'As sharp as anything, but I wonder if it would look better taken from a lower viewpoint, with only the mountains in the background.', '2005-02-05 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152329, 140839, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting. The sign seems a little soft on my screen, however.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting. The sign seems a little soft on my screen, however.', '2005-02-05 18:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152331, 141959, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sign really seems to stand out from the wall. Very topical, too.</td>', 'The sign really seems to stand out from the wall. Very topical, too.', '2005-02-05 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152332, 141982, 28359, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the plane makes it! 10</td>', 'Great shot, the plane makes it! 10', '2005-02-05 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152334, 142732, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great color and the composition works well too.  A flash would have brought the signs out more though...</td>', 'Great color and the composition works well too.  A flash would have brought the signs out more though...', '2005-02-05 18:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152335, 140668, 24212, '<td valign="top">The picture seems to be rather on the small side.</td>', 'The picture seems to be rather on the small side.', '2005-02-05 18:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152339, 140486, 24212, '<td valign="top">Although the sign is bright against the dark background, it doesn''t seem to ''pop'' as it might. Maybe a little more sharpening?</td>', 'Although the sign is bright against the dark background, it doesn''t seem to ''pop'' as it might. Maybe a little more sharpening?', '2005-02-05 18:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152341, 142344, 24212, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that the light from the flash is so harsh.</td>', 'It''s a pity that the light from the flash is so harsh.', '2005-02-05 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152343, 141613, 24212, '<td valign="top">Is this really a road sign? Interesting shot though.</td>', 'Is this really a road sign? Interesting shot though.', '2005-02-05 18:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152344, 141915, 24212, '<td valign="top">This picture is rather on the small side and the sky looks a little overexposed. Good idea for a challenge entry.</td>', 'This picture is rather on the small side and the sky looks a little overexposed. Good idea for a challenge entry.', '2005-02-05 18:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152348, 141191, 24212, '<td valign="top">Really sharp and clear. I could just sit and look at the texture for ages.</td>', 'Really sharp and clear. I could just sit and look at the texture for ages.', '2005-02-05 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152351, 141657, 24212, '<td valign="top">This seems to be neither abstract enough nor sharp enough to me. Perhaps the street lights were too bright to get the light trails to really stand out.</td>', 'This seems to be neither abstract enough nor sharp enough to me. Perhaps the street lights were too bright to get the light trails to really stand out.', '2005-02-05 18:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152353, 142665, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and very sharp. Monotone works well here.</td>', 'Interesting composition and very sharp. Monotone works well here.', '2005-02-05 18:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152356, 140126, 24212, '<td valign="top">Strange haloing in the signs - is this the shadow/highlight tool a little overdone? Notwithstanding that, it makes for a pleasant image.</td>', 'Strange haloing in the signs - is this the shadow/highlight tool a little overdone? Notwithstanding that, it makes for a pleasant image.', '2005-02-05 18:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152359, 142546, 24212, '<td valign="top">I know it would be difficult to achieve, but I feel that the tree to the left could do with being a little less well lit.</td>', 'I know it would be difficult to achieve, but I feel that the tree to the left could do with being a little less well lit.', '2005-02-05 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152363, 140576, 24212, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see this taken with a slower shutter speed, so that the light trail is longer.</td>', 'I would prefer to see this taken with a slower shutter speed, so that the light trail is longer.', '2005-02-05 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152367, 142086, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture with subtle colours.</td>', 'A lovely picture with subtle colours.', '2005-02-05 18:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152371, 142731, 28359, '<td valign="top">Very Cool! 10</td>', 'Very Cool! 10', '2005-02-05 18:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152372, 142442, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sign is nice and sharp, but the top half of the background is a bit too busy.</td>', 'The sign is nice and sharp, but the top half of the background is a bit too busy.', '2005-02-05 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152375, 142342, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lower half looks a little too dark to let the detail jump out.</td>', 'The lower half looks a little too dark to let the detail jump out.', '2005-02-05 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152377, 142738, 24212, '<td valign="top">Is this a ''Beware of Siege Engines'' sign. As far as composition goes, I feel that the sign obscures the tower too much.</td>', 'Is this a ''Beware of Siege Engines'' sign. As far as composition goes, I feel that the sign obscures the tower too much.', '2005-02-05 18:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152380, 142414, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite put my finger on why, but this picture just looks too empty.</td>', 'I can''t quite put my finger on why, but this picture just looks too empty.', '2005-02-05 18:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152383, 141920, 24212, '<td valign="top">On my screen at least, the signs seem to have suffered from the compression of the image. Good capture of the snow.</td>', 'On my screen at least, the signs seem to have suffered from the compression of the image. Good capture of the snow.', '2005-02-05 18:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152384, 142718, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the sign.</td>', 'Great lighting on the sign.', '2005-02-05 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152385, 141140, 24212, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that the sign is so dirty.</td>', 'It''s a pity that the sign is so dirty.', '2005-02-05 18:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152386, 141954, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the signs have taken on the same appearance as the trees.</td>', 'I like the way that the signs have taken on the same appearance as the trees.', '2005-02-05 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152387, 142485, 24212, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit dark for me.</td>', 'This seems a bit dark for me.', '2005-02-05 18:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152389, 142526, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very stark, but I don''t really see ''road sign'' here.</td>', 'Very stark, but I don''t really see ''road sign'' here.', '2005-02-05 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152390, 142475, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can''t really get the impression of road signs here.</td>', 'I can''t really get the impression of road signs here.', '2005-02-05 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152391, 141061, 24212, '<td valign="top">That could have fallen on you at any moment.</td>', 'That could have fallen on you at any moment.', '2005-02-05 18:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152394, 141603, 24212, '<td valign="top">The sign really stands out here.</td>', 'The sign really stands out here.', '2005-02-05 18:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152395, 142473, 28359, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could had been a good shot.....too small to tell.......resize on the longest side at 600 t 640</td>', 'Looks like it could had been a good shot.....too small to tell.......resize on the longest side at 600 t 640', '2005-02-05 18:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152396, 142367, 24212, '<td valign="top">It''s a little difficult to make out the sign with the silhouettes of the trees behind.</td>', 'It''s a little difficult to make out the sign with the silhouettes of the trees behind.', '2005-02-05 18:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152397, 142108, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like it, it works well. 9</td>', 'I like it, it works well. 9', '2005-02-05 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152398, 142369, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the fence spoils this somewhat and the sky looks a bit overeposed. Both things that couldn''t be easily dealt with in basic editing, I know.</td>', 'I feel that the fence spoils this somewhat and the sky looks a bit overeposed. Both things that couldn''t be easily dealt with in basic editing, I know.', '2005-02-05 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152399, 140612, 19116, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  The strength and dignity of the subjects really come through.  B&amp;W was a good choice and adds a lot, but  I''m afraid a lot of people won''t pick up on the "sign" here.  Non-literal interpretations of the challenge always seem to get hammered.  Hope it does well though.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  The strength and dignity of the subjects really come through.  B&W was a good choice and adds a lot, but  I''m afraid a lot of people won''t pick up on the "sign" here.  Non-literal interpretations of the challenge always seem to get hammered.  Hope it does well though.', '2005-02-05 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152400, 142444, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is confusing for me - I like the colors and lines, but feel frustrated by not being able to figure out what the words say.</td>', 'This is confusing for me - I like the colors and lines, but feel frustrated by not being able to figure out what the words say.', '2005-02-05 18:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152403, 142223, 28359, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2005-02-05 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152405, 142417, 31133, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great entry - I love the umbrella interpretation! Unfortunately, the image size is frustratingly small. Hope you add the larger version to your portfolio.</td>', 'This looks like a great entry - I love the umbrella interpretation! Unfortunately, the image size is frustratingly small. Hope you add the larger version to your portfolio.', '2005-02-05 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152471, 142710, 28261, '<td valign="top">Although you really need to use the largest format possible in presenting your challenge entries (640 largest side), I can see this shot has great potential and give it a 7.</td>', 'Although you really need to use the largest format possible in presenting your challenge entries (640 largest side), I can see this shot has great potential and give it a 7.', '2005-02-05 19:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152540, 142574, 26653, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more effective with a deeper depth of field.</td>', 'I think this would be more effective with a deeper depth of field.', '2005-02-05 21:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152543, 140492, 26653, '<td valign="top">I wish you had done more with the composition.</td>', 'I wish you had done more with the composition.', '2005-02-05 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152569, 142223, 31815, '<td valign="top">what are the odds? Nice shot!!!</td>', 'what are the odds? Nice shot!!!', '2005-02-05 22:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152584, 141281, 33224, '<td valign="top">it say''s it all</td>', 'it say''s it all', '2005-02-05 22:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152586, 141959, 33224, '<td valign="top">good timing</td>', 'good timing', '2005-02-05 22:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152626, 142620, 31319, '<td valign="top">The repetitious design of the background windows is almost entrancing, then the viewer realizes, "Yes.  Go!  Go!"  A photo I kept coming back to.</td>', 'The repetitious design of the background windows is almost entrancing, then the viewer realizes, "Yes.  Go!  Go!"  A photo I kept coming back to.', '2005-02-05 23:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152628, 140883, 31319, '<td valign="top">Perfectly balanced in color as well as dof vs absolute clarity.</td>', 'Perfectly balanced in color as well as dof vs absolute clarity.', '2005-02-05 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152645, 142221, 31319, '<td valign="top">Technically consummate.  Compositionally, I yearned to see a little less sky and  a little more of the building that is so undeniably "grand."</td>', 'Technically consummate.  Compositionally, I yearned to see a little less sky and  a little more of the building that is so undeniably "grand."', '2005-02-05 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152704, 141523, 30929, '<td valign="top">You lose a little in the loss of colour intensity at the bottom of the shot.  If it had been cropped Just under the horizon  (probably the same distance as is between the botom of the sign and the horizon), it would have kept the high impact colour saturation and grittines of the ageing sign that first attracted me. The field is just a little too soft (iin colour and composition) to do the focus of the picture justice.  I like the shot though... Nicely done.</td>', 'You lose a little in the loss of colour intensity at the bottom of the shot.  If it had been cropped Just under the horizon  (probably the same distance as is between the botom of the sign and the horizon), it would have kept the high impact colour saturation and grittines of the ageing sign that first attracted me. The field is just a little too soft (iin colour and composition) to do the focus of the picture justice.  I like the shot though... Nicely done.', '2005-02-06 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152711, 141568, 30929, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The title of your shot would hold more if the horizon (and other land based objects!) were not in the frame. Maybe shoot up a little more or crop it higher (from the bottom) I like the blue / blue / white composition though.. well done!</td>', 'Nice shot.  The title of your shot would hold more if the horizon (and other land based objects!) were not in the frame. Maybe shoot up a little more or crop it higher (from the bottom) I like the blue / blue / white composition though.. well done!', '2005-02-06 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152712, 142737, 30929, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2005-02-06 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152716, 142237, 30929, '<td valign="top">Was there a little camera shake until / after your flash fired? I can''t decide if the movement is distracting or helps add focus to the sign.  Maybe softer or  more consistant bidirrectional movement would clear it up a little</td>', 'Was there a little camera shake until / after your flash fired? I can''t decide if the movement is distracting or helps add focus to the sign.  Maybe softer or  more consistant bidirrectional movement would clear it up a little', '2005-02-06 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152719, 142432, 30929, '<td valign="top">hehe... i like this one...</td>', 'hehe... i like this one...', '2005-02-06 00:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152721, 141151, 30929, '<td valign="top">The telstra logos are more pronounced than your sign and takes a little away from it compositionally  .. I like the concept, I think it just needs a little more work.  Maybe in the colour balance / distribution?</td>', 'The telstra logos are more pronounced than your sign and takes a little away from it compositionally  .. I like the concept, I think it just needs a little more work.  Maybe in the colour balance / distribution?', '2005-02-06 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152723, 142691, 30929, '<td valign="top">The sign is a little a lost in the mtion blur, but the mountain stands out.  I would have tried to keep the focus / sharpness on the sign...</td>', 'The sign is a little a lost in the mtion blur, but the mountain stands out.  I would have tried to keep the focus / sharpness on the sign...', '2005-02-06 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152724, 140883, 30929, '<td valign="top">I like the shot...</td>', 'I like the shot...', '2005-02-06 00:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152725, 142701, 30929, '<td valign="top">great sign, just not enough going on in the photo...</td>', 'great sign, just not enough going on in the photo...', '2005-02-06 00:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152726, 141531, 30929, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot without the sign (unfortunate I know!!)</td>', 'This would have been a great shot without the sign (unfortunate I know!!)', '2005-02-06 00:42:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1152732, 140989, 30929, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.   A longer exposure that got the car lights all the way accross the shot behind the stop sign would have added a great compositional element.  The bacon sign in the background is a little distracting though. Still give it 7</td>', 'Great contrast.   A longer exposure that got the car lights all the way accross the shot behind the stop sign would have added a great compositional element.  The bacon sign in the background is a little distracting though. Still give it 7', '2005-02-06 00:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152734, 142712, 30929, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the grittines</td>', 'I like the framing and the grittines', '2005-02-06 00:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152735, 142600, 30929, '<td valign="top">I like it.. Great idea and excellent composition / excution. My favourite so far... (and I am almost a tthe end!!) Only little thing is it is a shame about the rust line on the sign.</td>', 'I like it.. Great idea and excellent composition / excution. My favourite so far... (and I am almost a tthe end!!) Only little thing is it is a shame about the rust line on the sign.', '2005-02-06 00:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152736, 142417, 30929, '<td valign="top">Good concept, shame the shot is so small.</td>', 'Good concept, shame the shot is so small.', '2005-02-06 00:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152737, 142421, 30929, '<td valign="top">There is not enough ''oomph'' in the sign. It kinda looks like a metal baking tray...</td>', 'There is not enough ''oomph'' in the sign. It kinda looks like a metal baking tray...', '2005-02-06 00:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152744, 141244, 30929, '<td valign="top">This has kinda been done before:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=11185</td>', 'This has kinda been done before://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=11185', '2005-02-06 00:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152746, 142108, 30929, '<td valign="top">nice use of the zoom effect</td>', 'nice use of the zoom effect', '2005-02-06 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152747, 142221, 30929, '<td valign="top">The sign needs more grounding...  Try rotating the image slightly to make the sign straight.</td>', 'The sign needs more grounding...  Try rotating the image slightly to make the sign straight.', '2005-02-06 01:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152749, 142422, 30929, '<td valign="top">Levels might have made the piece of paper look a little less obvious..  Also a larger font would have made it look more ''street sign'' like.</td>', 'Levels might have made the piece of paper look a little less obvious..  Also a larger font would have made it look more ''street sign'' like.', '2005-02-06 01:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152755, 142205, 30929, '<td valign="top">photo seems blurry. Was this taken from a moving vehicle?</td>', 'photo seems blurry. Was this taken from a moving vehicle?', '2005-02-06 01:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152758, 142588, 30929, '<td valign="top">the hot spot kills this picture - also  a title to do with old people taking romantic walks would have added to it.</td>', 'the hot spot kills this picture - also  a title to do with old people taking romantic walks would have added to it.', '2005-02-06 01:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152763, 141519, 30929, '<td valign="top">Shot is very grainy... maybe black &amp; white would have helped...</td>', 'Shot is very grainy... maybe black & white would have helped...', '2005-02-06 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152765, 142735, 30929, '<td valign="top">the branch in front of the sign takes away from it''s impact a little.</td>', 'the branch in front of the sign takes away from it''s impact a little.', '2005-02-06 01:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152766, 142102, 30929, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desat...</td>', 'I like the selective desat...', '2005-02-06 01:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152768, 141403, 30929, '<td valign="top">centre framing takes away from the shot.  Maybe rule of 1/3 would apply here, and create some nice negative space?</td>', 'centre framing takes away from the shot.  Maybe rule of 1/3 would apply here, and create some nice negative space?', '2005-02-06 01:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152770, 141519, 31889, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been a good shot if taken with at high resolution.</td>', 'This would''ve been a good shot if taken with at high resolution.', '2005-02-06 01:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152774, 142572, 17185, '<td valign="top">The more I see of snow bound streets the happier I am I''m in the sub-tropics. Thanks for your photo.</td>', 'The more I see of snow bound streets the happier I am I''m in the sub-tropics. Thanks for your photo.', '2005-02-06 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152776, 142725, 25599, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky....nice job</td>', 'Awesome sky....nice job', '2005-02-06 01:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152792, 141954, 33233, '<td valign="top">Composition makes the background distracting, flat color, the sign gets lost in the trees</td>', 'Composition makes the background distracting, flat color, the sign gets lost in the trees', '2005-02-06 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152794, 141981, 33233, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation; so-so composition; so-so lighting</td>', 'Interesting interpretation; so-so composition; so-so lighting', '2005-02-06 02:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
