(1152952, 142137, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the fisheye, love the composition! The snow is a too blue for me, but that''s the only thing I can criticize.</td>', 'Love the fisheye, love the composition! The snow is a too blue for me, but that''s the only thing I can criticize.', '2005-02-06 04:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152953, 141115, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clever, but I feel that the sign is a little too dark.</td>', 'Very clever, but I feel that the sign is a little too dark.', '2005-02-06 04:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152954, 142735, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the sign is a little too lost among the branches and that the bush in the bottom left should be cropped out.</td>', 'I think that the sign is a little too lost among the branches and that the bush in the bottom left should be cropped out.', '2005-02-06 04:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152957, 141505, 24212, '<td valign="top">Contrasty and bright. Unfortunately I feel that the shadow in front of the tram is a little too deep and the sign on the top of it seems a touch overexposed.</td>', 'Contrasty and bright. Unfortunately I feel that the shadow in front of the tram is a little too deep and the sign on the top of it seems a touch overexposed.', '2005-02-06 04:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152958, 142699, 24212, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2005-02-06 04:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152960, 142563, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fantastic wave! This is my favorite so far - the cropping is beautiful and it''s great that you managed to get that wave so perfectlly frozen. I like that you didn''t show any sand.  Perfect colors, too.</td>', 'Fantastic wave! This is my favorite so far - the cropping is beautiful and it''s great that you managed to get that wave so perfectlly frozen. I like that you didn''t show any sand.  Perfect colors, too.', '2005-02-06 04:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152961, 142708, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you''ve managed to capture the lower sign in shadow. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the way you''ve managed to capture the lower sign in shadow. Nice work.', '2005-02-06 04:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152963, 140612, 24212, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I miss the ''road sign'' connection here.</td>', 'Sorry, but I miss the ''road sign'' connection here.', '2005-02-06 04:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152965, 141981, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve cropped the bottom of the sign off. It would be too easy to just include the whole sign.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve cropped the bottom of the sign off. It would be too easy to just include the whole sign.', '2005-02-06 04:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152966, 142339, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the sign is wedged in the top corner.</td>', 'I like the way that the sign is wedged in the top corner.', '2005-02-06 04:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152968, 142420, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice setup - the street lamp adds a lot, and good lighting on the two road signs (especially the ''no right turn'') so they''re still visible. It''s too bad that there''s a street lamp over the ''no entry'' sign. Good composition / cropping. I think the graininess adds to the image, but would like to see a lilttle more sharpness around the signs - otherwise, I like the soft focus.</td>', 'Nice setup - the street lamp adds a lot, and good lighting on the two road signs (especially the ''no right turn'') so they''re still visible. It''s too bad that there''s a street lamp over the ''no entry'' sign. Good composition / cropping. I think the graininess adds to the image, but would like to see a lilttle more sharpness around the signs - otherwise, I like the soft focus.', '2005-02-06 04:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152969, 141309, 24212, '<td valign="top">The motion blur of the car is well captured here. It makes this all come to life. Great vibrant colours and sharpness.</td>', 'The motion blur of the car is well captured here. It makes this all come to life. Great vibrant colours and sharpness.', '2005-02-06 04:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152971, 142468, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Great use of shallow depth of field.', '2005-02-06 04:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152972, 142322, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very simple. Very neat.</td>', 'Very simple. Very neat.', '2005-02-06 04:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152975, 142718, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors - the D, G, E lack of focus is a little distracting and maybe a little burnt.  I I I      I think the color balance and composition as a whole are good.</td>', 'Beautiful colors - the D, G, E lack of focus is a little distracting and maybe a little burnt.  I I I      I think the color balance and composition as a whole are good.', '2005-02-06 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152976, 140794, 24212, '<td valign="top">You''ve done well to avoid under- or over- exposed patches in lighting such as these.</td>', 'You''ve done well to avoid under- or over- exposed patches in lighting such as these.', '2005-02-06 04:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152977, 142479, 24212, '<td valign="top">A dramatic study with lots of texture.</td>', 'A dramatic study with lots of texture.', '2005-02-06 04:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152978, 142540, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great composition.</td>', 'Great subject, great composition.', '2005-02-06 04:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152979, 141475, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really nice. The fact that you''ve cropped all but the crosswalk and used a fisheye (?) to make the curvature draws my eye to the upper right nicely, and it such a way that it feels the crosswalk never ends. Fantastic b&amp;w balance, too.</td>', 'Really nice. The fact that you''ve cropped all but the crosswalk and used a fisheye (?) to make the curvature draws my eye to the upper right nicely, and it such a way that it feels the crosswalk never ends. Fantastic b&w balance, too.', '2005-02-06 04:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152980, 142600, 31133, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition / idea, but it suffers (in my opinion) from way too much sharpness and color distortion on the gravel. I think the image might be improved with levels an/or a little less brightness. But I love the composition.</td>', 'I really like this composition / idea, but it suffers (in my opinion) from way too much sharpness and color distortion on the gravel. I think the image might be improved with levels an/or a little less brightness. But I love the composition.', '2005-02-06 04:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152981, 142498, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great idea and title. This is a little too complicated, though. I think it would benefit from an out of focus background.</td>', 'Great idea and title. This is a little too complicated, though. I think it would benefit from an out of focus background.', '2005-02-06 04:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152983, 141223, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Wish the b&amp;w had a more pronounce black to white range, because I think that would give the photo a little more pizazz. Bumping up your score though, because I think the capture is awesome.</td>', 'Nice shot. Wish the b&w had a more pronounce black to white range, because I think that would give the photo a little more pizazz. Bumping up your score though, because I think the capture is awesome.', '2005-02-06 04:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152987, 142426, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape photo -  I like the colors and dof. Would like to see the sign placed a little more towards the right edge, but only a little bit closer to the edge.</td>', 'Nice landscape photo -  I like the colors and dof. Would like to see the sign placed a little more towards the right edge, but only a little bit closer to the edge.', '2005-02-06 04:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1152996, 140612, 33240, '<td valign="top">love the interpretation of the title, good to see something different from everything else</td>', 'love the interpretation of the title, good to see something different from everything else', '2005-02-06 05:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
