(1153039, 142204, 28367, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors. I''m not too keen on the border though. But that might just be a matter of taste.</td>', 'Great composition and colors. I''m not too keen on the border though. But that might just be a matter of taste.', '2005-02-06 07:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
