(1153042, 142417, 14028, '<td valign="top">good shot,houmuristic!but i guess you should upload a bigger file(about 500 pixels) i found by own experience that people vote more with bigger images.gave it a 7</td>', 'good shot,houmuristic!but i guess you should upload a bigger file(about 500 pixels) i found by own experience that people vote more with bigger images.gave it a 7', '2005-02-06 07:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153043, 141189, 28367, '<td valign="top">Funny shot! I like the lighting as well.</td>', 'Funny shot! I like the lighting as well.', '2005-02-06 07:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153045, 142460, 28367, '<td valign="top">Wow, this was a photo that surprised me! Great subject and well executed.</td>', 'Wow, this was a photo that surprised me! Great subject and well executed.', '2005-02-06 07:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153046, 141144, 28367, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity you couldn''t spot edit those orange spots on the sign. I really like the dramatic sky.</td>', 'It''s a pity you couldn''t spot edit those orange spots on the sign. I really like the dramatic sky.', '2005-02-06 07:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153050, 141657, 28367, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it was intentional, but the tilted horizon bugs me a little. The effect is cool though.</td>', 'I don''t know if it was intentional, but the tilted horizon bugs me a little. The effect is cool though.', '2005-02-06 07:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153053, 142710, 28367, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s too small, cause I really like the pic.</td>', 'Too bad it''s too small, cause I really like the pic.', '2005-02-06 07:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153066, 140907, 32482, '<td valign="top">Oh! So that is where then been keeping his brains! I was wondering why he is an idiot...good capture!</td>', 'Oh! So that is where then been keeping his brains! I was wondering why he is an idiot...good capture!', '2005-02-06 08:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153076, 140975, 27845, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that part of the cross is cropped off at the left. Otherwise, it is a very appealing image with nice colours and a clear composition. 7.</td>', 'It''s a pity that part of the cross is cropped off at the left. Otherwise, it is a very appealing image with nice colours and a clear composition. 7.', '2005-02-06 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153085, 140839, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the message of your picture is. If it is what I think it is (and I hope I''m wrong), you''re saying that it''s annoying to have parking space reserved for handicapped people. If so, I think you should reconsider your attitude towards those people who have been less lucky in their life than most. In Luxembourg, we have a slogan running beneath Parking signs for handicapped: ''If you take my parking, take my handicap as well.''<br/>If on the other hand I''m completely wrong, please tell me so. I''d be terribly sorry to have  done you wrong because of a misunderstanding.<br/>For voting, I''ll consider only the image''s appeal without considering whatever meaning there may be attached to it: 6.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the message of your picture is. If it is what I think it is (and I hope I''m wrong), you''re saying that it''s annoying to have parking space reserved for handicapped people. If so, I think you should reconsider your attitude towards those people who have been less lucky in their life than most. In Luxembourg, we have a slogan running beneath Parking signs for handicapped: ''If you take my parking, take my handicap as well.''If on the other hand I''m completely wrong, please tell me so. I''d be terribly sorry to have  done you wrong because of a misunderstanding.For voting, I''ll consider only the image''s appeal without considering whatever meaning there may be attached to it: 6.', '2005-02-06 09:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153092, 142485, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very nice sign, nicely composed</td>', 'Very nice sign, nicely composed', '2005-02-06 09:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153094, 142223, 31443, '<td valign="top">nice shot......funny! did you put a sticker on the mirror?</td>', 'nice shot......funny! did you put a sticker on the mirror?', '2005-02-06 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153097, 141484, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nicely done even though including the actual molehills would have been nice...I can see them though (I think)</td>', 'Nicely done even though including the actual molehills would have been nice...I can see them though (I think)', '2005-02-06 09:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1153179, 142406, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of this framing. Nicely done. 10</td>', 'I like the contrast of this framing. Nicely done. 10', '2005-02-06 11:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
