(1153190, 142731, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great job if it is legal. I am interested to read your notes on how you did this. It works for me. I like the ghostlike framing of the trees, and the saturated color is an effective touch. 9</td>', 'Great job if it is legal. I am interested to read your notes on how you did this. It works for me. I like the ghostlike framing of the trees, and the saturated color is an effective touch. 9', '2005-02-06 11:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
