(1153195, 142737, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great Capture. Great use of black and white. I think I would have cropped it a little tighter on the left. Still, great shot. 8</td>', 'Great Capture. Great use of black and white. I think I would have cropped it a little tighter on the left. Still, great shot. 8', '2005-02-06 11:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
