(1154478, 142363, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the image quality is really suffering in this shot, it has too many highlights and some pretty horrible artefacts above the highlighted cloud and the sign itself seems a bit out of focus and the lighting of it isn´t very flattering.  Keep on experimenting though, you are on the right track so don´t get discouraged.</td>', 'Good idea, but the image quality is really suffering in this shot, it has too many highlights and some pretty horrible artefacts above the highlighted cloud and the sign itself seems a bit out of focus and the lighting of it isn´t very flattering.  Keep on experimenting though, you are on the right track so don´t get discouraged.', '2005-02-07 05:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154498, 142716, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the image quality is letting you down here.  To be specific the blown out sky behind him is really a killer here, along with a very odd look on the snow behind him, it seems textureless and has an odd colour.<br/> <br/>Anyway, love his expression, it´s like he´s waiting for an electritian to fix his problem or something and it´s a good idea like I said before.  Next time you could try to measure the exposure with the sky in mind and if it´s too bright, try taking it at another time of day to eliminate the blown out sky.</td>', 'Good idea, but the image quality is letting you down here.  To be specific the blown out sky behind him is really a killer here, along with a very odd look on the snow behind him, it seems textureless and has an odd colour. Anyway, love his expression, it´s like he´s waiting for an electritian to fix his problem or something and it´s a good idea like I said before.  Next time you could try to measure the exposure with the sky in mind and if it´s too bright, try taking it at another time of day to eliminate the blown out sky.', '2005-02-07 06:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154499, 141223, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, love the b/w but I am not sure of what people that don´t speak Icelandic will make of the sign since there are no international marks on it.<br/> <br/>Gaf henni sjöu, gangi þér vel.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, love the b/w but I am not sure of what people that don´t speak Icelandic will make of the sign since there are no international marks on it. Gaf henni sjöu, gangi þér vel.', '2005-02-07 06:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
