(1155112, 141788, 25218, '<td valign="top">Seems like it would have been easier to have a "forward only" sign, instead of this mess... well observed with a great title! The signs seem a bit gray - in Photoshop (or what have you), you can make the whites of the signs be truely white by using Levels, and it would have made the photo brighter &amp; not so murky.</td>', 'Seems like it would have been easier to have a "forward only" sign, instead of this mess... well observed with a great title! The signs seem a bit gray - in Photoshop (or what have you), you can make the whites of the signs be truely white by using Levels, and it would have made the photo brighter & not so murky.', '2005-02-07 13:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
