(1155463, 141753, 33317, '<td valign="top">Effective b&amp;w! the sign is a bit dark and I think that the arrangement of buildings/sign is a bit confusing. The field definitely and hills in background give depth.</td>', 'Effective b&w! the sign is a bit dark and I think that the arrangement of buildings/sign is a bit confusing. The field definitely and hills in background give depth.', '2005-02-07 16:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
