(1155472, 142037, 33317, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the sign, though the touch-up may be too much. The overpass curve adds a lot to composition.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the sign, though the touch-up may be too much. The overpass curve adds a lot to composition.', '2005-02-07 16:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
