(1158606, 142090, 31307, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by typologic:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL<br/>I''d score it higher if it was an actual street sign ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s what''s so cool about it: it IS...okay...WAS an actual road sign.  My friend and some others got it from some sign post near Seattle I believe.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-09 00:20:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by typologic: LOLI''d score it higher if it was an actual street sign ;)   That''s what''s so cool about it: it IS...okay...WAS an actual road sign.  My friend and some others got it from some sign post near Seattle I believe.', '2005-02-09 00:20:02.000000', '2005-02-09 00:20:22.000000', 0),
(1158607, 142712, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am upset that this didn''t reach more people. There is something that fascinates me in this. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but would have been a 10 from me.</td>', 'I am upset that this didn''t reach more people. There is something that fascinates me in this. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but would have been a 10 from me.', '2005-02-09 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
