(1158626, 142344, 32672, '<td valign="top">I think some people judged it poorly perhaps because they didn''t count is as applicible for the challenge because of it lack of being in an area involving roads.  However, the challenge was titled, verbatim, "Road Signs IV," and I distinctly see a road sign, don''t you?  It follows the rule of thirds, it''s in focus, it makes a humorous statement...I don''t see anything wrong with it.  I like it.</td>', 'I think some people judged it poorly perhaps because they didn''t count is as applicible for the challenge because of it lack of being in an area involving roads.  However, the challenge was titled, verbatim, "Road Signs IV," and I distinctly see a road sign, don''t you?  It follows the rule of thirds, it''s in focus, it makes a humorous statement...I don''t see anything wrong with it.  I like it.', '2005-02-09 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1158631, 140075, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit, the bisection with the road. The reflection off the ice and blue tone is really nice. I''m afraid you probably suffered in the voting because the road sign was not obvious, but a nice shot regardless of the challenge.</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit, the bisection with the road. The reflection off the ice and blue tone is really nice. I''m afraid you probably suffered in the voting because the road sign was not obvious, but a nice shot regardless of the challenge.', '2005-02-09 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1158638, 142356, 31637, '<td valign="top">I tend to be real harsh when it comes to fitting a theme. I saw your photo and realized your sign was not a traffic road sign and immediately gave you a 5 because you did not technically fit the theme, and your composition is nice overall and I thought you did a great job with the lighting. I do understand why you came in 4th place though. Congrats ! well deserving</td>', 'I tend to be real harsh when it comes to fitting a theme. I saw your photo and realized your sign was not a traffic road sign and immediately gave you a 5 because you did not technically fit the theme, and your composition is nice overall and I thought you did a great job with the lighting. I do understand why you came in 4th place though. Congrats ! well deserving', '2005-02-09 00:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
