(1159002, 141568, 27719, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for your comments, I really appreciate them.<br/>Most of you have suggested that cropping above would have improved the picture, eliminating distracting/non-interesting elements. In some aspect, I agree with that, in fact I tried this before posting to this challenge, but to my taste the picture got even less interesing, so I prefered not to lose the signal echoes. Probably in basic editing there''s not much more to do here. In my opinion, the problem with this picture is the picture itself :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-09 04:46:12.</i></td>', 'Thank you very much for your comments, I really appreciate them.Most of you have suggested that cropping above would have improved the picture, eliminating distracting/non-interesting elements. In some aspect, I agree with that, in fact I tried this before posting to this challenge, but to my taste the picture got even less interesing, so I prefered not to lose the signal echoes. Probably in basic editing there''s not much more to do here. In my opinion, the problem with this picture is the picture itself :)', '2005-02-09 03:01:22.000000', '2005-02-09 04:46:12.000000', 0),
