(1159127, 141971, 30443, '<td valign="top">I am happy with the final results.  It was hard to get the sign in the photo at all..I was standing in snow up to my knees taking my life in my hands as cars wizzed by me on a busy road. The biggest problem here, was that there was a road between the sign and the cemetery. Thanks for the comments..it helps me realize what could have been better. AJFI</td>', 'I am happy with the final results.  It was hard to get the sign in the photo at all..I was standing in snow up to my knees taking my life in my hands as cars wizzed by me on a busy road. The biggest problem here, was that there was a road between the sign and the cemetery. Thanks for the comments..it helps me realize what could have been better. AJFI', '2005-02-09 06:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
