(1163029, 141859, 32570, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NinjaMom:</b></div><hr/><i> Why is there another sign coming in from the top? Am I missing something? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The reflection is from the sign reflecting off of my UV filter onto the lens.<br/> <br/>It is what made me find the image interesting...</td>', 'Originally posted by NinjaMom: Why is there another sign coming in from the top? Am I missing something?   The reflection is from the sign reflecting off of my UV filter onto the lens. It is what made me find the image interesting...', '2005-02-11 02:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1163121, 142205, 30791, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blurredvision:</b></div><hr/><i> photo seems blurry. Was this taken from a moving vehicle? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>yeah i zoomed in a little bit digitally but what ever it was funny, i wasnt planning to score high on this challenge<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by blurredvision: photo seems blurry. Was this taken from a moving vehicle?  yeah i zoomed in a little bit digitally but what ever it was funny, i wasnt planning to score high on this challenge', '2005-02-11 06:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
