(1163383, 142459, 3102, '<td valign="top">You know, I kept looking at this shot while voting, thinking it looked familiar to me... I did some digging, and sure enough, it''s one of my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=145700" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vacation photos</a> from 1988!  That was also a trip where I was experimenting with a polarizing filter for the first time.  I love how yours came out!  Doesn''t look like the place has changed a lot in 17 years... thanks for the memories and congrats on the ribbon!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-11 10:57:09.</i></td>', 'You know, I kept looking at this shot while voting, thinking it looked familiar to me... I did some digging, and sure enough, it''s one of my vacation photos from 1988!  That was also a trip where I was experimenting with a polarizing filter for the first time.  I love how yours came out!  Doesn''t look like the place has changed a lot in 17 years... thanks for the memories and congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-02-11 10:56:28.000000', '2005-02-11 10:57:09.000000', 0),
