(1165243, 142673, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like this and would of scored it atleast a 7 had I vote, to get any better, if you had just moved a touch to the left and got a more right angle acute like:) Defanetly would of gave it a 9 or 10 cause I like the colors. It reminds me of when I was a little girl. I''d play on the snow where they had scraped and shoveled it all in a pile. :)  I''d play till my fingers and toes were numb and beyond.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-12 14:23:06.</i></td>', 'I like this and would of scored it atleast a 7 had I vote, to get any better, if you had just moved a touch to the left and got a more right angle acute like:) Defanetly would of gave it a 9 or 10 cause I like the colors. It reminds me of when I was a little girl. I''d play on the snow where they had scraped and shoveled it all in a pile. :)  I''d play till my fingers and toes were numb and beyond.', '2005-02-12 14:21:44.000000', '2005-02-12 14:23:06.000000', 0),
