(1168699, 142442, 33467, '<td valign="top">Hey Rick! New Salem State Park! I used to live in Springfield on West Lawrence Avenue! Now in Siberia.  Doing some contractual work for a magazine. Nice shot. Where did they put all the cows and pigs though??<br/> <br/>SPR</td>', 'Hey Rick! New Salem State Park! I used to live in Springfield on West Lawrence Avenue! Now in Siberia.  Doing some contractual work for a magazine. Nice shot. Where did they put all the cows and pigs though?? SPR', '2005-02-14 12:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1171298, 141309, 4207, '<td valign="top">Howdy from the CC:<br/>For me, this image has a lot of destracting elements from the primary subject. It seems to me that the images that do the best on this site have a single clear, visually intresting subject. This image seems to go for more of a story telling angle. <br/> <br/>The coloration is clear and the focus is sharp. I do enjoy the motion blur of the BMW. I think the best way to make this image stronger is to remove the destractions. IE, take off the watch and perhaps the this image either deep in the city where the building have a unifor look or out in the country where, there are now buildings/roadsigns. Great idea for an images and bear in mind that many voters don''t go for "comedy" images and "vulgar" images. Keep it up, it seem you have the techinical ability to create quality images, now just play around with subject matter. IMHO.</td>', 'Howdy from the CC:For me, this image has a lot of destracting elements from the primary subject. It seems to me that the images that do the best on this site have a single clear, visually intresting subject. This image seems to go for more of a story telling angle.  The coloration is clear and the focus is sharp. I do enjoy the motion blur of the BMW. I think the best way to make this image stronger is to remove the destractions. IE, take off the watch and perhaps the this image either deep in the city where the building have a unifor look or out in the country where, there are now buildings/roadsigns. Great idea for an images and bear in mind that many voters don''t go for "comedy" images and "vulgar" images. Keep it up, it seem you have the techinical ability to create quality images, now just play around with subject matter. IMHO.', '2005-02-15 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1171305, 142731, 4207, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the CC:<br/>Ok, this image I think need a bit more of a clean look. I think the approach is right on the money but perhaps the context of a city street or a bus in the background would add to the feeling your going for. The motion blur makes the image but the bushes/trees are detracting from the subject. The trees have a strange color to them that appears to be accidental. Just my opinion.<br/>Keep it up.<br/>aj</td>', 'Greetings from the CC:Ok, this image I think need a bit more of a clean look. I think the approach is right on the money but perhaps the context of a city street or a bus in the background would add to the feeling your going for. The motion blur makes the image but the bushes/trees are detracting from the subject. The trees have a strange color to them that appears to be accidental. Just my opinion.Keep it up.aj', '2005-02-15 15:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1171318, 142473, 4207, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the CC: <br/>Ok, the images is waaaaay too tiny. You have a 4.1 Mpxl camera that can easily handle producing quality 640pxl images. This image could produce great results but simply is to small to really get into it. <br/> <br/>The power lines are distracting and so is the tower. There isn''t a lot you can do to eliminate them but from a viewer''s standpoint, it''s destracting. Maybe a landscape format would be better for this image. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work!<br/>aj</td>', 'Greetings from the CC: Ok, the images is waaaaay too tiny. You have a 4.1 Mpxl camera that can easily handle producing quality 640pxl images. This image could produce great results but simply is to small to really get into it.  The power lines are distracting and so is the tower. There isn''t a lot you can do to eliminate them but from a viewer''s standpoint, it''s destracting. Maybe a landscape format would be better for this image.  Keep up the good work!aj', '2005-02-15 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1182841, 142459, 26723, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-02-19 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1183037, 142579, 14986, '<td valign="top">What a cool place to live and a wonderful eye for capturing this with the sign.  Lighting could be a little better, as things look a little dark to my eye, but sometimes you just work with what you have.  I do think I would probably crop more of the bottom portion of the photo, as I don''t think that pile of snow really adds anything to the composition.  By cropping that off, my eye goes more naturally to the sign and building, and less to the foreground.   Hope this helps!</td>', 'What a cool place to live and a wonderful eye for capturing this with the sign.  Lighting could be a little better, as things look a little dark to my eye, but sometimes you just work with what you have.  I do think I would probably crop more of the bottom portion of the photo, as I don''t think that pile of snow really adds anything to the composition.  By cropping that off, my eye goes more naturally to the sign and building, and less to the foreground.   Hope this helps!', '2005-02-19 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1188009, 142579, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is so sweet. I didnt know churches like this existed with a sign like that. It sure could very well be heaven as pretty as it is. You did good with this as far as framing.. Maybe a little more sun or earlier in the day would give it the right amount of light for it to really shine.</td>', 'This is so sweet. I didnt know churches like this existed with a sign like that. It sure could very well be heaven as pretty as it is. You did good with this as far as framing.. Maybe a little more sun or earlier in the day would give it the right amount of light for it to really shine.', '2005-02-22 07:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1190808, 140485, 31738, '<td valign="top">LOL This photo is funny, I wonder how they could honestly put up a wrong sign like that and just leave it there lol. Geez, You won''t catch me driving in the UK that''s for sure haha.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-23 13:11:11.</i></td>', 'LOL This photo is funny, I wonder how they could honestly put up a wrong sign like that and just leave it there lol. Geez, You won''t catch me driving in the UK that''s for sure haha.', '2005-02-23 13:10:27.000000', '2005-02-23 13:11:11.000000', 0),
