(1225929, 142249, 2798, '<td valign="top">I like the stars on the streetlights but I''m finding little else in this image that really draws my eye. The street sign is there of course but once I''ve taken that in I find myself hunting for what I''m seeing in the rest of the image. It takes me a moment to figure out that it''s a tunnel or a bridge with perhaps a train travelling over the top. <br/> <br/>The usual lack of clarity problem is there and it''s especially aparrent on the second street sign to the right of the main one. There''s are blurred patches that make it difficult to read.</td>', 'I like the stars on the streetlights but I''m finding little else in this image that really draws my eye. The street sign is there of course but once I''ve taken that in I find myself hunting for what I''m seeing in the rest of the image. It takes me a moment to figure out that it''s a tunnel or a bridge with perhaps a train travelling over the top.  The usual lack of clarity problem is there and it''s especially aparrent on the second street sign to the right of the main one. There''s are blurred patches that make it difficult to read.', '2005-03-14 04:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
