(1861812, 141186, 10858, '<td valign="top">No, vanalism is truly not exciting composition, it''s sad. This is a no-drive-in road sing squeezed to a different direction. Would you drive through the fence, if the sign was not there? :-)<br/> <br/>This is not my final idea, but as I had to keep the rules, I had to stop at his stage. In the description there you can find the advanced edited version of this, which is rather a mood photo than a still life.</td>', 'No, vanalism is truly not exciting composition, it''s sad. This is a no-drive-in road sing squeezed to a different direction. Would you drive through the fence, if the sign was not there? :-) This is not my final idea, but as I had to keep the rules, I had to stop at his stage. In the description there you can find the advanced edited version of this, which is rather a mood photo than a still life.', '2005-11-13 07:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
